      "content": "i know you're trying to be kind but it feels so hollow. it's like you're telling me to just wait around while everything i built falls apart. but there’s no \"finding myself\" if i'm just a constant burden to them. there's this part of me that thinks... maybe it would be more merciful to just leave it here. at the peak. before i become the person who is constantly apologizing for existing and just draining their lives away. wouldn't it be easier if i just stayed the version they're proud of, instead of making them watch me fail for years?",
